{"auto_generated": false, "lang": "en", "segments": [{"duration": 1.15, "start": 0.533, "text": "In this video,"}, {"duration": 2.317, "start": 1.683, "text": "we will explore\nGraphical Editing Preferences."}, {"duration": 2.284, "start": 5.066, "text": "With the schematic as the\nactive document,"}, {"duration": 1.566, "start": 7.35, "text": "open the Preferences."}, {"duration": 3.5, "start": 9.966, "text": "Select Schematic\nand Graphical Editing."}, {"duration": 2.75, "start": 14.333, "text": "Ensure Always Drag is enabled."}, {"duration": 3.6, "start": 19.8, "text": "Dragging a component shows that\nall the connected wires to that component"}, {"duration": 1.316, "start": 23.4, "text": "remain connected."}, {"duration": 2.733, "start": 26.433, "text": "To move the component\nwithout maintaining connection,"}, {"duration": 1.5, "start": 29.166, "text": "hold the ‘Ctrl’ key,"}, {"duration": 2.684, "start": 30.666, "text": "then left-click\nand drag a component."}, {"duration": 2.766, "start": 33.9, "text": "Let’s drag component U2\nas an example."}, {"duration": 2.166, "start": 37.1, "text": "Notice that now the preference is ignored"}, {"duration": 3.25, "start": 39.266, "text": "and the component is moved\nindependently from the wires."}, {"duration": 1.483, "start": 43.633, "text": "With any preference setting,"}, {"duration": 1.7, "start": 45.116, "text": "pressing and holding\nthe ‘Ctrl’ key"}, {"duration": 2.317, "start": 46.816, "text": "will temporarily ignore\nthe preference setting."}, {"duration": 1.7, "start": 50.9, "text": "Going back to the Preferences,"}, {"duration": 1.234, "start": 52.866, "text": "select Schematic,"}, {"duration": 1.4, "start": 54.1, "text": "Graphical Editing."}, {"duration": 1.234, "start": 56.016, "text": "Ensure that the option"}, {"duration": 4.183, "start": 57.25, "text": "Display Names of Special Strings\nthat have No Value Defined is enabled."}, {"duration": 2.267, "start": 62.166, "text": "Click OK to exit the Preferences."}, {"duration": 1.567, "start": 65.383, "text": "Viewing the Title Block,"}, {"duration": 2.5, "start": 66.95, "text": "we see that some of the text strings\npoint to parameters"}, {"duration": 2.216, "start": 69.45, "text": "which currently\ndon't have a value assigned."}, {"duration": 3.15, "start": 71.9, "text": "Therefore, the parameter name is shown\ninstead of its value."}, {"duration": 2.266, "start": 75.75, "text": "With no objects selected\nin the schematic,"}, {"duration": 1.566, "start": 78.2, "text": "open the Properties panel."}, {"duration": 2.083, "start": 80.633, "text": "This shows the document properties."}, {"duration": 1.366, "start": 82.95, "text": "Within the Properties panel,"}, {"duration": 1.75, "start": 84.316, "text": "select the Parameters tab."}, {"duration": 4.067, "start": 86.866, "text": "Enter the value of 1.0 into the\nRevision parameter, as shown."}, {"duration": 2.083, "start": 92.35, "text": "The revisions string within\nthe Title Block"}, {"duration": 2.4, "start": 94.433, "text": "has now been updated\nto reflect the new value"}, {"duration": 1.767, "start": 96.833, "text": "within the Revision parameter."}, {"duration": 1.0, "start": 99.533, "text": "In this video,"}, {"duration": 2.083, "start": 100.533, "text": "we explored\nGraphical Editing Preferences"}, {"duration": 1.65, "start": 102.616, "text": "within Altium Designer."}], "source": "innertube", "videoId": "Z9EIhkTDtIo", "video_id": "Z9EIhkTDtIo", "title": "Altium Training - Schematic Preferences: Graphical Editing Preferences"}